ptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-23T13:34:12Z","updated_at":"2024-11-23T13:34:12Z","body":"Thanks for the report! Consolidating in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/45354, as this is due to the same cause.\n\n> Notably, even files that shouldn't have been saved, like the shaders which weren't even open at the time, were wiped\n\nGodot likely attempted to save these files anyway, even if it's only to change their modification date. This will happen especially if you had shaders opened in the shader editor bottom panel, even if the bottom panel is currently collapsed.\n\nThere's an issue tracking this for `project.godot` in particular, but I can't find it right now.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495481855/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]